{"id":347,"path":"/grammar-points/b1-b2/indirect-questions/","parentId":332,"order":20,"section":"grammar-points","level":"b1-b2","depth":3,"title":"Indirect questions","seo":{"title":"Indirect questions - Test-English","description":"Learn how to form indirect questions (embedded questions) in this B1+ grammar lesson. Clear rules, charts and exercises. Practise now!","image":"/media/uploads/B2.1_Indirect-questions.png"},"modified":"2026-03-10T08:53:42","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose the correct forms to complete the following questions. There are direct and indirect questions.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"270\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose the correct forms to complete the questions below.&nbsp;There are direct and indirect questions.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"269\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Turn these direct questions into indirect questions.</h5> <p><em>EXAMPLE:&nbsp;Where is the shop?</em> ⇒ <em>Can you tell me <span class=\"textGap\">where the shop is</span>?</em><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"8\"></div> <p></p>"],"explanation":"<p><img src=\"/media/uploads/Indirect-questions-grammar-chart-1.webp\" alt=\"Infographic illustrating the structure of direct and indirect questions in English grammar with examples, displayed on a bright, color-coded chart.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-30260\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <p>We normally use <strong>indirect questions</strong>&nbsp;when we want to be more polite. We begin the question with expressions such as “Can you tell me …?”, “Could you tell me …?”, “Do you know …?”, or “Would you mind telling me …?”</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>What time is it?</em> (direct question)</li> <li><em><span><strong>Could you tell me</strong></span> what time it is?</em>&nbsp;(indirect question)</li> </ul> <p>In indirect questions, the order is subject + verb.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>Do you know where <span><strong>can I</strong></span> find a bank? <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em>Do you know where <span><strong>I can</strong></span> find a bank?</em> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>Can you tell me what time<span><strong> do the shops close</strong></span>? <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em>Can you tell me what time<span><strong> the shops close</strong></span>?&nbsp;</em><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> </ul> <p>These are some other common expressions used before indirect questions:</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>I don’t know</strong></span> what he is doing here.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>I wonder</strong></span> when he will find the truth.</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>I’m not sure</strong></span> when I can come.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><span><em><strong>I’d like to know</strong></em></span><em> where you left the documents.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <p>For <strong>yes-no questions</strong> (when there is NO&nbsp;question word), we can use both&nbsp;<strong>if</strong> or&nbsp;<strong>whether</strong>:</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>Do you know <span><strong>if/whether</strong></span> he’ll be here soon?</em></li> </ul>","quizzes":[{"id":270,"questions":[{"id":2357,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I don't know the answer. How many times <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> to tell you?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["I do have","I have","do I have"]}]},{"id":2358,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I don't know&nbsp;<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> so unhappy.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["why is he always","why he's always","whether is he always"]}]},{"id":2359,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Do you have any idea when <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["will be the results published","the results will be published","will the results be published"]}]},{"id":2365,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>How many people <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> for the party?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["did you call","called you","you called"]}]},{"id":2362,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I wonder <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["how long this cold weather will last","how long will this cold weather last","how this cold weather will last"]}]},{"id":2363,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Did she tell you how often <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["you should take the vitamins","do you take the vitamins","should you take the vitamins"]}]},{"id":2364,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'd like to know <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> for the experiment.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["if can I use the new product","whether I can use the new product","whether can I use the new product"]}]},{"id":2366,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Could you tell me why <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["do you leave","you are leaving","are you leaving"]}]},{"id":2367,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Can I ask you how long <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> here?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["have you been living","have you lived","you have been living"]}]},{"id":2368,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Why <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["I wouldn't call her","shouldn't I call her","I shouldn't call her"]}]}]},{"id":269,"questions":[{"id":2349,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I'd like to know ______.</div>","choices":[{"id":3500,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>how can I contact her</span>"},{"id":3501,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>how I can contact her</span>"},{"id":3502,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>how do I contact her</span>"}]},{"id":2350,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I was wondering&nbsp;______&nbsp;the recipe.</div>","choices":[{"id":3503,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>where you found </span>"},{"id":3504,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>where did you find</span>"},{"id":3505,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>where found you </span>"}]},{"id":2351,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Would you mind telling me ______?</div>","choices":[{"id":3506,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>how much did the sofa cost</span>"},{"id":3507,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>how much cost the sofa</span>"},{"id":3508,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>how much the sofa cost</span>"}]},{"id":2360,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>How long ______ to finish the project?</div>","choices":[{"id":3524,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>it is going to take</span>"},{"id":3525,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>is it going to take</span>"},{"id":3526,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>it's going to take</span>"}]},{"id":2352,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>______ in this house?</div>","choices":[{"id":3509,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>How much time you have been living</span>"},{"id":3510,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>How long you've been living</span>"},{"id":3511,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>How long have you been living</span>"}]},{"id":2353,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Could you tell me ______?</div>","choices":[{"id":3512,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>what are you afraid </span>"},{"id":3513,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>what you are afraid </span>"},{"id":3514,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>what you are afraid of</span>"}]},{"id":2354,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Do you know ______?</div>","choices":[{"id":3515,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>if is he going to come</span>"},{"id":3516,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>if he's going to come</span>"},{"id":3517,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>whether is he going to come</span>"}]},{"id":2355,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I'd like to know&nbsp;______ .</div>","choices":[{"id":3518,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>why you are acting so weird</span>"},{"id":3519,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>why are you acting so weird</span>"},{"id":3520,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>why act you so weird</span>"}]},{"id":2356,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Do you have any idea&nbsp;______?</div>","choices":[{"id":3521,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>is who the man in black</span>"},{"id":3522,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>who's the man in black</span>"},{"id":3523,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>who the man in black is</span>"}]},{"id":2369,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>______? Can you tell me?</div>","choices":[{"id":3530,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Where is the new student from</span>"},{"id":3531,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Where the new student is from</span>"},{"id":3532,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>From where is the new student</span>"}]}]},{"id":8,"questions":[{"id":53,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Where is he from? ⇒ Do you know&nbsp;<span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":54,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>How many countries has he travelled to? ⇒ I wonder&nbsp;<span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":55,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Where did you go? ⇒ Can you tell me&nbsp;<span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":56,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Have you finished the report yet? ⇒ I'd like to know&nbsp;<span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":57,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Does he go out very often? ⇒ I've no idea whether&nbsp;<span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":58,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Who was&nbsp;she talking to? ⇒ I wonder who&nbsp;<span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":59,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Where is the nearest station? ⇒ Could you tell me where&nbsp;<span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":60,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Why can't you help your new colleague? ⇒ Would you mind telling me why&nbsp;<span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":61,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>What is our new boss like? ⇒ I'd like to find out what&nbsp;<span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":62,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>How&nbsp;could you do that? ⇒ I don't know how&nbsp;<span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}